(7442770, 1177042, 156466, '<td valign="top">Interesting enough photograph but I''m having a difficult time trying to reconcile it with the challenge description and guidelines.</td>', 'Interesting enough photograph but I''m having a difficult time trying to reconcile it with the challenge description and guidelines.', '2016-03-10 11:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7442771, 1177012, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice spooky mood, but I''m losing minor detail in the vignette against the light framing of the site.  Could use a little less contrast.  Background houses/condos take away from the isolation I''d like to see in a shot like this.</td>', 'Nice spooky mood, but I''m losing minor detail in the vignette against the light framing of the site.  Could use a little less contrast.  Background houses/condos take away from the isolation I''d like to see in a shot like this.', '2016-03-10 11:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7442772, 1176977, 156466, '<td valign="top">Seems to me that the mood here is expressed more by the object itself than anything you''ve done to set a tone.</td>', 'Seems to me that the mood here is expressed more by the object itself than anything you''ve done to set a tone.', '2016-03-10 11:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7442773, 1176982, 156466, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, but I''m having a tough time trying to find a "mood" specifically expressed here.</td>', 'Lovely photo, but I''m having a tough time trying to find a "mood" specifically expressed here.', '2016-03-10 11:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7442774, 1176902, 156466, '<td valign="top">Like the idea. Would have loved to see it a little more worn, and the paper in particular, to be convincing.</td>', 'Like the idea. Would have loved to see it a little more worn, and the paper in particular, to be convincing.', '2016-03-10 11:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7442778, 1176964, 156466, '<td valign="top">So many objects here that could/should have served as the title here to make this wonderful image fit the challenge description. Alas I''m left wondering what was the mundane object you wanted to show me, and if it''s the Art Gallery then it''s the least interesting here - and there''s a lot of interesting.</td>', 'So many objects here that could/should have served as the title here to make this wonderful image fit the challenge description. Alas I''m left wondering what was the mundane object you wanted to show me, and if it''s the Art Gallery then it''s the least interesting here - and there''s a lot of interesting.', '2016-03-10 11:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7442779, 1176978, 156466, '<td valign="top">Watch the sharpening halos</td>', 'Watch the sharpening halos', '2016-03-10 11:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7442780, 1177035, 156466, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred "bicycle" as the title.</td>', 'I would have preferred "bicycle" as the title.', '2016-03-10 11:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7442781, 1176698, 156466, '<td valign="top">Which one?</td>', 'Which one?', '2016-03-10 11:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7442782, 1177013, 156466, '<td valign="top">Needs a proper title for the challenge, and there are many out there to choose from.</td>', 'Needs a proper title for the challenge, and there are many out there to choose from.', '2016-03-10 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7442783, 1176580, 156466, '<td valign="top">Needs a proper title for the challenge.</td>', 'Needs a proper title for the challenge.', '2016-03-10 11:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7442784, 1176842, 156466, '<td valign="top">Having a difficult time with the red at the tip of the print. If it''s an artifact or a result of processing then it distracts, if it''s something in the mud then I want a better look at it or to have its impact reduced as its presence is still more a distraction than something that intrigues me.</td>', 'Having a difficult time with the red at the tip of the print. If it''s an artifact or a result of processing then it distracts, if it''s something in the mud then I want a better look at it or to have its impact reduced as its presence is still more a distraction than something that intrigues me.', '2016-03-10 11:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7442787, 1176935, 156466, '<td valign="top">I love the image - one of my favorites thus far. I can''t help but think that the title speaks more to the mood than the object, which wasn''t the objective. Or I''m just looking at it differently. I guess I find more "mood" in a thrown away bouquet than I do in the beautified compost bucket.  Regardless, well conceived.</td>', 'I love the image - one of my favorites thus far. I can''t help but think that the title speaks more to the mood than the object, which wasn''t the objective. Or I''m just looking at it differently. I guess I find more "mood" in a thrown away bouquet than I do in the beautified compost bucket.  Regardless, well conceived.', '2016-03-10 12:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7442788, 1176624, 156466, '<td valign="top">Mood = Anticipation or Anxiety</td>', 'Mood = Anticipation or Anxiety', '2016-03-10 13:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
