(7442939, 1176982, 35804, '<td valign="top">Lightness...is that a mood? This is really lovely. The trees seem like they a dancing and those clouds! Fantastic.</td>', 'Lightness...is that a mood? This is really lovely. The trees seem like they a dancing and those clouds! Fantastic.', '2016-03-10 17:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7442940, 1176985, 35804, '<td valign="top">To be honest, I''m not sure what the mood is...but this is so light, fresh and thought provoking. I want to call it quench.</td>', 'To be honest, I''m not sure what the mood is...but this is so light, fresh and thought provoking. I want to call it quench.', '2016-03-10 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7442942, 1176562, 35804, '<td valign="top">I want to say despair, then again I don''t. There''s something foreboding, but then there is this beautiful light...it''s a mystery with an uncertain ending.</td>', 'I want to say despair, then again I don''t. There''s something foreboding, but then there is this beautiful light...it''s a mystery with an uncertain ending.', '2016-03-10 17:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7442943, 1177025, 35804, '<td valign="top">Calm, quiet...love the simplicity of this and that gorgeous soft light that reminds of the days beginning or end. Very nice.</td>', 'Calm, quiet...love the simplicity of this and that gorgeous soft light that reminds of the days beginning or end. Very nice.', '2016-03-10 17:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7442949, 1176624, 35804, '<td valign="top">I wish I could give this something more than a 10...10 isn''t enough. This is a story. It''s a little sexy, a bit of a mystery mixed with pieces of another time and place...ennui enters my mind also. It''s a strange mix but I like it.</td>', 'I wish I could give this something more than a 10...10 isn''t enough. This is a story. It''s a little sexy, a bit of a mystery mixed with pieces of another time and place...ennui enters my mind also. It''s a strange mix but I like it.', '2016-03-10 17:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
