(7443576, 1176962, 80096, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image! Congrats on your ribbon! <br/>Just want to add that when I first looked at this it gave me the willies.. I immediately imagined myself falling head over heels down this frozen stairway. I don''t think there''s a safe way to negotiate this which is what makes it so effective. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-03-13 22:49:13.</i></td>', 'Fantastic image! Congrats on your ribbon! Just want to add that when I first looked at this it gave me the willies.. I immediately imagined myself falling head over heels down this frozen stairway. I don''t think there''s a safe way to negotiate this which is what makes it so effective. ', '2016-03-11 12:59:58.000000', '2016-03-13 22:49:13.000000', 0),
